 proofs/lang/expr_facts.v          |  16 ++++
 proofs/lang/safety_common.v       |  29 +++++-
 proofs/lang/safety_common_proof.v | 147 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 190 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 proofs/lang/safety_common_proof.v

